To fix the "The query requires an index" error, I will modify the `CollaborativeSession` component to perform the sorting of session history on the client side (in JavaScript) instead of requesting a sorted list from Firestore. This avoids the need to create a composite index in the Firebase console, which simplifies setup and resolves the error immediately.

I will also ensure `scrollToBottom` is correctly defined before it is used.

