To implement the **Chat History**, **File Uploads**, and **Audio Messaging** features while maintaining the strict pairing and session logic we've built, I will update `components/CollaborativeSession.tsx`.

### Features Added:
1.  **History Sidebar**: Displays a list of all past sessions with the last message and timestamp. Clicking a session allows you to "View" (read-only) or "Connect" (live).
2.  **File Uploads**: Added an attachment button (paperclip/plus icon) that allows uploading Images (`.png`, `.jpg`) and Documents (`.pdf`, `.docx`, `.pptx`) up to 50MB.
3.  **Audio Messaging**: Added a microphone button. Pressing it replaces the text input with a recording interface. Sending uploads the audio and renders a player for both users.

